      <guid>https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/playing-the-game/how-to-play/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-toc gdoc-toc__level--6&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;nav id=&#34;TableOfContents&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#placing-a-stone&#34;&gt;Placing a stone&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#the-magnifying-glass&#34;&gt;The magnifying glass&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#the-computer-player&#34;&gt;The computer player&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#computer-vs-computer-game&#34;&gt;Computer vs. computer game&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#let-the-computer-play-for-you&#34;&gt;Let the computer play for you&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#making-a-move-for-the-computer&#34;&gt;Making a move for the computer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#discarding-moves&#34;&gt;Discarding moves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#game-information&#34;&gt;Game information&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;      &lt;hr /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;placing-a-stone&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;        Placing a stone&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/playing-the-game/how-to-play/#placing-a-stone&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Placing a stone&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Placing a stone&#34; href=&#34;#placing-a-stone&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-columns gdoc-columns--regular flex gap-16 flex-mobile-column&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-columns__content gdoc-markdown--nested flex-even&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figure class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__figure&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link--raw&#34; href=&#34;https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/playing-the-game/how-to-play/place-stone-without-magnifying-glass.gif&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;picture&gt;&#xA;          &lt;img&#xA;                src=&#34;https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/playing-the-game/how-to-play/place-stone-without-magnifying-glass.gif&#34;&#xA;              alt=&#34;Placing a stone&#34;&#xA;          /&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/picture&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;        &lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;          Placing a stone&#xA;        &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-columns__content gdoc-markdown--nested flex-even&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;p&gt;Once you have &lt;a&#xA;  class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link&#34;&#xA;  href=&#34;https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/playing-the-game/start-a-new-game/&#34;&#xA;&gt;started a new game&lt;/a&gt; you are ready to begin playing.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Scoring</title>
      <link>https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/playing-the-game/scoring/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/playing-the-game/scoring/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-toc gdoc-toc__level--6&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;nav id=&#34;TableOfContents&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#scoring-systems&#34;&gt;Scoring systems&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#area-scoring-and-territory-scoring&#34;&gt;Area scoring and territory scoring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#why-area-scoring-is-the-default&#34;&gt;Why area scoring is the default&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#area-scoring-and-territory-scoring-revisited&#34;&gt;Area scoring and territory scoring, revisited&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#how-to-view-the-score&#34;&gt;How to view the score&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#activating-and-leaving-scoring-mode&#34;&gt;Activating and leaving scoring mode&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#how-to-activate-scoring-mode&#34;&gt;How to activate scoring mode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#how-to-leave-scoring-mode&#34;&gt;How to leave scoring mode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#life--death-settling&#34;&gt;Life &amp;amp; death settling&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#territory-markup&#34;&gt;Territory markup&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#marking-dead-stones&#34;&gt;Marking dead stones&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#assistance-with-marking-dead-stones&#34;&gt;Assistance with marking dead stones&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#marking-stones-in-seki&#34;&gt;Marking stones in seki&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;        &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#inconsistent-territory&#34;&gt;Inconsistent territory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;      &lt;hr /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;scoring-systems&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;        Scoring systems&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/playing-the-game/scoring/#scoring-systems&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Scoring systems&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Scoring systems&#34; href=&#34;#scoring-systems&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h3 id=&#34;area-scoring-and-territory-scoring&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;        Area scoring and territory scoring&#xA;    &lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/playing-the-game/scoring/#area-scoring-and-territory-scoring&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Area scoring and territory scoring&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Area scoring and territory scoring&#34; href=&#34;#area-scoring-and-territory-scoring&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;When you start a new game you can choose whether you want to play according to area or territory scoring rules (sometimes also known as Chinese or Japanese rules). Because the scoring rules may affect decisions how to play, you are not allowed to change the scoring rules in the middle of the game.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
