ass=&#34;flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h3 id=&#34;resigning&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;        Resigning&#xA;    &lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/playing-the-game/end-of-the-game/#resigning&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Resigning&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Resigning&#34; href=&#34;#resigning&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You can resign when it is your turn to play by selecting &amp;ldquo;Resign&amp;rdquo; from the menu that pops up when you tap the Menu &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon menu-hamburger&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#menu-hamburger&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt; button.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
